WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:07,970
Story in the park.

2
00:00:07,970 --> 00:00:11,470
Children, let's play a game.

3
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:14,460
Great!

4
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:24,120
Find something green.

5
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:26,320
A green frog.

6
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:30,180
Good job!

7
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:36,220
Find something white.

8
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:41,960
A white bird.

9
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:45,350
A white duck.

10
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:46,790
Well done!

11
00:00:46,790 --> 00:00:56,470
Two yellow flowers.

12
00:00:56,470 --> 00:00:59,850
They are nice.

13
00:01:00,050 --> 00:01:04,910
One for you and one for me.

14
00:01:04,910 --> 00:01:11,990
No! Stop!

15
00:01:11,990 --> 00:01:19,780
Oh no!

16
00:01:19,780 --> 00:01:24,180
Let's go to the hospital.

17
00:01:24,180 --> 00:01:28,380
What can the children see in the park?
